      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n* One room already tenanted, 4 rooms available at 3,150 * Located on the east side of Galway Glenburren Park can be accessed by the Tuam or Headford Road. This spacious 4 bedroom detached home is immaculately presented, overlooking a large green in a quiet cul-de-sac. The ground floor comprises of large living room with open fire, wooden flooring, leather couches and large window facing south west. To the back of the property is the spacious kitchen / dining room which comes fully fitted with all mod cons. Patio doors lead to a paved back garden, which would receive the morning sun. On the first floor are four well-appointed bedrooms, all with storage with one room currently being used as a study, there are three two double beds & one single bed. The main bathroom is fully tiled with shower over the bath. On the second floor the attic has been fabulously converted to the master suite, complete with stylish en-suite with double shower and contemporary tiles, mirrored slide robes and large Velux windows which allow the light to flood in. The heating is oil fired in addition to the fireplace, and there is ample parking to the front of the property for two cars. A very central location for most schools, industrial estates and the city centre. A must see."
      },
